      "text": "PK id           uuid           default uuid()\nUK email        text           CHECK = lower(btrim(email))\n   displayName  text\n   passwordHash text           Argon2id ($argon2id$…)\n   role         Role\n   status       UserStatus     default ACTIVE\nFK createdById  uuid?          → User.id · SET NULL\n   createdAt    timestamptz(3)\n   updatedAt    timestamptz(3)\n\nidx (role)\nidx (createdById)",
      "originalText": "PK id           uuid           default uuid()\nUK email        text           CHECK = lower(btrim(email))\n   displayName  text\n   passwordHash text           Argon2id ($argon2id$…)\n   role         Role\n   status       UserStatus     default ACTIVE\nFK createdById  uuid?          → User.id · SET NULL\n   createdAt    timestamptz(3)\n   updatedAt    timestamptz(3)\n\nidx (role)\nidx (createdById)",
