      "text": "PK id           uuid\nUK tokenHash    text           SHA-256 del token (nunca el token)\nFK userId       uuid           → User.id · CASCADE\n   createdAt    timestamptz(3)\n   lastSeenAt   timestamptz(3) inactividad 30 min\n   expiresAt    timestamptz(3) caducidad absoluta 8 h\n   revokedAt    timestamptz?   logout / rotación\n   ip           text?\n   userAgent    text?\n\nidx (userId, revokedAt)\nidx (expiresAt)",
      "originalText": "PK id           uuid\nUK tokenHash    text           SHA-256 del token (nunca el token)\nFK userId       uuid           → User.id · CASCADE\n   createdAt    timestamptz(3)\n   lastSeenAt   timestamptz(3) inactividad 30 min\n   expiresAt    timestamptz(3) caducidad absoluta 8 h\n   revokedAt    timestamptz?   logout / rotación\n   ip           text?\n   userAgent    text?\n\nidx (userId, revokedAt)\nidx (expiresAt)",
