      "text": "PK id           uuid\n   occurredAt   timestamptz(3) default now()\n   action       text           AUTH_LOGIN_SUCCEEDED, …\n   outcome      AuditOutcome\n   actorId      uuid?          sin FK (a propósito)\n   targetType   text?\n   targetId     text?\n   ip           text?\n   userAgent    text?\n   metadata     jsonb          default '{}'\n\nidx (occurredAt DESC)\nidx (action, occurredAt DESC)\nidx (actorId, occurredAt DESC)",
